      "message": "Note that the `-gpios` (plural) suffix is required by some of Zephyr\u0027s devictree support.  It doesn\u0027t require that you support multiple GPIOs on the property.\n\nIn this case you\u0027re doing a hard-coded lookup at index 0, so you can drop the FOREACH stuff.\n\n\n\n```suggestion\n\t.wp_gpios \u003d GPIO_DT_SPEC_GET(DT_DRV_INST(0), wp_gpios),\n\t.ex_wp_gpios \u003d GPIO_DT_SPEC_GET(DT_DRV_INST(0), ex_wp_gpios),\n```",
